title: "NB SelfCare"
abstract: >-
  Local-first desktop application for everyday self-care: food, body measurements, habits, treatments, fasting
  and guided breaks, with weekly review, trends and a correctable history, synced over the local network with
  NB SelfCare Mobile, with no account and no telemetry.
